  "details": "Throughout VRChat's updates, the World Loading has been getting worse over time. It started off well by introducing changeable world loading environments as if it was a world on its own. From then, it's been getting worse. \n\nUsing the island loading screen with a palm tree, water, and a sunset as an example, it started off by simply standing on the island as if the loading screen was a world you chilled in until the actual world you were going to loads. \n\nThen it got worse by getting changed to making everything appear massive around you, as if you were no longer in a world but instead a 3d sphere. \n\nRecently, it got incredibly worse with a super dizzying and nauseating skybox that moves when your head moves, even if barely moving, during the second half of loading into a world. I have to close my eyes until I load into a world now.",
